## Maintainer review follow-up (2026-08-14)

Reviewed the complete 59-file diff against current `origin/main` and addressed every valid inline finding before the final gate:

- corrected both example models to `claude/claude-sonnet-5`;
- normalized explicit `nvidia/auto` through the same self-prefix stripping path as configured-provider auto resolution;
- centralized positive safe-integer Behavior ID validation at the `manage_behaviors` chokepoint and reused it in REST / `get_behavior`;
- rejected null, primitive, and array correction entries as 400 client faults;
- tenant-scoped the entity lookup used by Behavior listing;
- added `McpScopeRequiredError` to deterministic reaction failures;
- removed the remaining dead live-smoke Z.AI exclusion and stale catalog-provider source comment.

The Sentry reviewer suggestion to fall back to `NODE_ENV=production` was intentionally not applied: both app/worker images and docker-compose bake `NODE_ENV=production`, while the Helm production deployment explicitly sets `ENVIRONMENT=production`. Using `NODE_ENV` would relabel local compose events as production. The dedicated resolver now requires explicit `ENVIRONMENT=production`, downgrades a development runtime carrying a production tag, and has six focused tests.

### Additional red -> green evidence

- `nvidia/auto`: the regression assertion failed before normalization because it returned `nvidia/moonshotai/kimi-k2.6`; the shared-prefix fix returns `moonshotai/kimi-k2.6`, and the focused worker resolver suite passes.
- malformed Behavior IDs / corrections: the new focused contract tests failed before the shared validator and object guard; afterward the focused Bun set passed (62 tests) and the server utility Vitest set passed (6 tests).
- final Sentry typing failure from the first full preflight: `TS2559: Type ProcessEnv has no properties in common with type RuntimeEnvLike`. Passing the two explicit environment fields made `cd packages/server && bunx tsc --noEmit` exit 0 and `runtime-info.test.ts` pass 6/6.
- provider-removal cleanup: the no-credential live-provider smoke enumerated 17 catalog providers, skipped 51 credential-gated cases, and had 0 failures; the removed Z.AI entry is no longer special-cased.

Final exact-tree preflight: [Depot run 71kpn4kqnb](https://depot.dev/orgs/b9ffw2rv84/workflows/71kpn4kqnb) — all 18 jobs passed; attestation recorded for tree `ca14ae85ffa1141512863911740ef4876f91499d`.
